                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5cc69cc0-f7d6-37c6-9a90-21865d4d02f6",
                        "entry_id": "01ee91a4-e84c-3ebd-8ddb-d1c332e98f3a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to come running in, to come rushing in, to run (into)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f4d08e2-84f2-430c-88c1-4497f84f206b",
                                "sense_id": "5cc69cc0-f7d6-37c6-9a90-21865d4d02f6",
                                "text": "В ко́мнате, куда́ он вбежа́л вслед за де́вушкой, на старомо́дном дива́не из ко́нского во́лоса лежа́л, весь бе́лый — бе́лый с желтова́тыми отли́вами, как воск и́ли как дре́вний мра́мор, — ма́льчик лет четы́рнадцати, порази́тельно похо́жий на де́вушку, очеви́дно её брат.",
                                "translation": "In the room, into which he ran behind the girl, on an old-fashioned horse-hair sofa, lay a boy of fourteen, white all over—white, with a yellowish tinge like wax or old marble—he was strikingly like the girl, obviously her brother.",
                                "english": "In the room, into which he ran behind the girl, on an old-fashioned horse-hair sofa, lay a boy of fourteen, white all over—white, with a yellowish tinge like wax or old marble—he was strikingly like the girl, obviously her brother."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b44371bc-1019-4b74-a01d-1b4ca5b82aaf",
                                "sense_id": "5cc69cc0-f7d6-37c6-9a90-21865d4d02f6",
                                "text": "Овча́рки вбежа́ли в кабине́т и легли́ во́зле стола́.",
                                "translation": "The dogs ran into the office and lay down around the table.",
                                "english": "The dogs ran into the office and lay down around the table."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
